  "about": "The tractus of the formulary “Immaculate Conception of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Her foundations are upon the holy mountains: the Lord loves the gates of Sion above all the dwellings of Jacob. Glorious things have been said of you, O city of God. A man was born in her, and the Most High Himself has founded her." }
